  "notes": "Often used in literary and narrative contexts. In film and storytelling, {回想|かいそう}シーン means a flashback scene. The word carries a reflective, somewhat nostalgic tone.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{過去|かこ}を{回想|かいそう}する — to recall the past\n・{回想|かいそう}シーン — flashback scene\n・{回想|かいそう}{録|ろく} — memoirs, reminiscences\n・{回想|かいそう}にふける — to be lost in reminiscence",
